  description: 'The trains arrive on time. The lights come on before you reach the door. The rubbish is gone by morning. Behind every seamless moment in Horizon is Kuroko: a workforce that never tires, never strikes and never steps into the spotlight. We work in plain sight, and the show goes on. Kuroko.'
